OL,3,GNEWSAShoreham air crash anniversary a
OL,4,A'poignant day'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe mother of one of the men killed in
OL,7,Fthe Shoreham air show disaster 11 years
OL,8,Fago has said the anniversary is always
OL,9,Fa "very poignant day".
OL,11,FA service to mark the 11 years since
OL,12,Fthe crash was held in the town earlier,
OL,13,Fwith Caroline Schilt, whose son Jacob
OL,14,FSchilt lost his life, among those in
OL,15,Fattendance.
OL,17,FShe told the BBC: "It's good that all
OL,18,Fthe families come together, which is a
OL,19,Fcomfort... It really helps us all."
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
